#. Translators: keep the full meaning: predicted, research only, no diagnosis.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:308
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "PREDICTED — research use only, not for diagnosis"
msgstr "VORHERGESAGT — nur für Forschungszwecke, nicht für die Diagnostik"

#: ui/cellaris.slint:314
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "No slide"
msgstr "Kein Präparat"

#. Translators: closes the Cellaris panel.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:408
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Close"
msgstr "Schließen"

#. Translators: keep the full meaning; IF is immunofluorescence.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:435
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid ""
"The colours show what a model predicts the immunofluorescence would be. They "
"are not measurements: check them against measured IF before relying on them."
msgstr ""
"Die Farben zeigen, wie die Immunfluoreszenz nach der Vorhersage eines "
"Modells aussähe. Sie sind keine Messungen: Prüfen Sie sie anhand gemessener "
"IF, bevor Sie sich darauf verlassen."

#. Translators: tries again what failed (the model, cells).
#: ui/cellaris.slint:460
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Retry"
msgstr "Erneut versuchen"

#. Translators: a section heading, in capitals in English.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:472
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "SLIDE"
msgstr "PRÄPARAT"

#. Translators: a section heading, in capitals in English.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:489
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "PREDICTED MARKERS"
msgstr "VORHERGESAGTE MARKER"

#: ui/cellaris.slint:495
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Hide predictions"
msgstr "Vorhersagen ausblenden"

#: ui/cellaris.slint:495
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Show predictions"
msgstr "Vorhersagen anzeigen"

#. Translators: {} is a marker, such as Pan-CK.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:551
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Display window of {} (arcsinh)"
msgstr "Anzeigefenster von {} (arcsinh)"

#. Translators: the low end of a marker's display window: at or below it
#. nothing is drawn (black in fluorescence style).
#: ui/cellaris.slint:560
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Low"
msgstr "Untergrenze"

#. Translators: the high end of a marker's display window: at or above it the
#. marker is drawn in its full colour.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:588
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "High"
msgstr "Obergrenze"

#: ui/cellaris.slint:615
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid ""
"Only how predictions are drawn changes; readouts and batch runs keep their "
"values."
msgstr ""
"Nur die Darstellung der Vorhersagen ändert sich; Auswertungen und Batch-"
"Läufe behalten ihre Werte."

#. Translators: resets a marker's display window to Cellaris's own.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:622
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Reset"
msgstr "Zurücksetzen"

#. Translators: how opaque the predicted colours are drawn.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:636
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Opacity"
msgstr "Deckkraft"

#. Translators: {} is the opacity, in percent.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:652
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "{} %"
msgstr "{} %"

#: ui/cellaris.slint:662
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Fluorescence style: colour on black over all tissue"
msgstr "Fluoreszenzstil: Farbe auf Schwarz über dem gesamten Gewebe"

#. Translators: a check box; other messages quote its first words.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:671
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Assume the model's pixel size for slides that report none"
msgstr "Pixelgröße des Modells annehmen, wenn ein Präparat keine angibt"

#: ui/cellaris.slint:678
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid ""
"Colours are chosen to stay distinct with red-green and blue-yellow colour "
"blindness; hide markers to look at one at a time. Areas still being computed "
"are veiled; failed ones are outlined in red."
msgstr ""
"Die Farben sind so gewählt, dass sie auch bei Rot-Grün- und Blau-Gelb-"
"Sehschwäche unterscheidbar bleiben; blenden Sie Marker aus, um sie einzeln "
"zu betrachten. Noch in Berechnung befindliche Areale sind verschleiert; "
"fehlgeschlagene sind rot umrandet."

#. Translators: a section heading, in capitals in English: statistics of the
#. model's predicted values over a region (not a measurement).
#: ui/cellaris.slint:684
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "REGION READOUT"
msgstr "REGIONSAUSWERTUNG"

#. Translators: a column of the readout: the marker.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:707
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "marker"
msgstr "Marker"

#. Translators: a narrow column of the readout: the mean predicted value.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:709
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "mean"
msgstr "Mittel"

#. Translators: a narrow column of the readout: how much the value varies.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:711
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "spread"
msgstr "Streuung"

#. Translators: a narrow column: how much optical density alone explains.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:713
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "density r²"
msgstr "Dichte-r²"

#. Translators: picks the tool that outlines a region for a readout of the
#. predicted values.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:734
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Draw region"
msgstr "Region zeichnen"

#. Translators: makes the slide's region of interest (ROI) the readout's
#. region, instead of a drawn one; the readout follows the ROI.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:741
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Use ROI"
msgstr "ROI verwenden"

#. Translators: stops the region readout.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:751
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Cancel"
msgstr "Abbrechen"

#. Translators: copies the region readout as text.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:758
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Copy"
msgstr "Kopieren"

#. Translators: removes the readout's region and its readout.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:766
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Clear"
msgstr "Entfernen"

#. Translators: explains the readout's columns; keep the meaning exact; the 5
#. µm blocks are small squares of tissue, not paraffin blocks.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:775
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid ""
"Mean is the predicted intensity, arcsinh, over tissue in the region, and "
"spread how much it varies between 5 µm blocks. Density r² is how much of "
"that variation optical density alone reproduces. Near 1, the marker is a "
"density map here. Low with a small spread means the prediction is flat, not "
"that it learned anything. Low with a wide spread is needed for it to be the "
"marker, but only measured IF shows it is. Numbers come from the same blended "
"predictions the overlay shows."
msgstr ""
"„Mittel“ ist die vorhergesagte Intensität (arcsinh) über dem Gewebe in der "
"Region, „Streuung“ gibt an, wie stark sie zwischen 5-µm-Quadraten variiert. "
"„Dichte-r²“ gibt an, wie viel dieser Variation die optische Dichte allein "
"reproduziert. Nahe 1 ist der Marker hier eine Dichtekarte. Ein niedriger "
"Wert bei kleiner Streuung bedeutet, dass die Vorhersage flach ist, nicht "
"dass das Modell etwas gelernt hat. Ein niedriger Wert bei großer Streuung "
"ist nötig, damit es sich um den Marker handeln kann, aber nur gemessene IF "
"zeigt, dass es so ist. Die Zahlen stammen aus denselben überblendeten "
"Vorhersagen, die die Überlagerung zeigt."

#. Translators: a section heading, in capitals in English.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:781
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "MODEL"
msgstr "MODELL"

#. Translators: opens a file dialog to choose the model file.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:805
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Choose model…"
msgstr "Modell wählen…"

#. Translators: opens a form to download the model through eov.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:807
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Download model…"
msgstr "Modell herunterladen…"

#. Translators: opens a file dialog to choose ONNX Runtime's library.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:809
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Choose runtime…"
msgstr "Runtime wählen…"

#. Translators: above the fields for the model's address and SHA-256.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:824
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Your site's copy of the model, and its SHA-256:"
msgstr "Adresse der Modellkopie Ihrer Einrichtung und ihre SHA-256:"

#. Translators: hex digits are 0–9 and a–f.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:834
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "SHA-256 (64 hex digits)"
msgstr "SHA-256 (64 Hexadezimalziffern)"

#. Translators: downloads the model from the address given.
#: ui/cellaris.slint:840
msgctxt "CellarisPanel"
msgid "Download"
msgstr "Herunterladen"
